Raylib (via raylib-go)
----------------------

Gru uses Raylib through github.com/gen2brain/raylib-go/raylib for rendering and
windowing. The Go module wraps Raylib C sources (zlib/libpng-style license).

Copyright (c) 2013-2024 Ramon Santamaria (@raysan5)
License: Zlib (raylib) — see module LICENSE

https://www.raylib.com/
https://github.com/gen2brain/raylib-go

go-licenses note: the package contains non-Go C code that is not further
inspected by the license scanner; Raylib’s own LICENSE applies to that code.

