---

Microsoft Edge WebView2 (Windows)
-----------------------------------

When Gru hosts embedded web content on Windows (`-tags webview2`), the Microsoft
Edge WebView2 runtime is used on the end-user machine. Microsoft WebView2
redistribution and runtime terms apply to installers and end users.

https://developer.microsoft.com/microsoft-edge/webview2/

Document the WebView2 runtime requirement in build docs (staging/BUILD.md).

Vendored host: github.com/wailsapp/go-webview2 → ./internal/go-webview2
(MIT for the Go package; webviewloader reported ISC by go-licenses).

